=== GALACTIC PILOT GUIDE: 3D NAVIGATION & HAZARDS ===

The universe spans a 3D coordinate grid of 30x15x5 (2,250 sectors).
* VECTORS: Navigate in 6 cardinal directions:
    [N]orth / [S]outh (Y-axis)
    [E]ast  / [W]est  (X-axis)
    [U]p    / [D]own  (Z-axis)

* AUTOWARP & PLOT: Compute shortest hyperspace routes across sectors.
* HAZARDS & ANOMALIES:
  - Asteroid Belts: Mine rich fuel ore deposits.
  - Wormholes: Instantaneous conduits across distant sectors.
  - Cosmic Storms: Ionized clouds that drain deflector shields.
  - Black Holes: Gravitational singularities with extreme danger.
  - Derelicts: Abandoned hulls ripe for salvage operations.
